Volta — clean-room rewrite (2026-10-10)
=======================================

The code in this directory (rewrite/) is original work of Qompass AI,
written from a behavior/interface specification derived from public
protocol specifications (HKP, the keys.openpgp.org VKS API, the Web
Key Directory draft, OpenPGP RFC 9580, RFC 9980, FIPS 203, FIPS 204)
and from the predecessor's published documentation and black-box
behavior. It is not copied from, and does not derive from, the Hagrid
codebase. The predecessor tree outside this directory remains
Hagrid-derived and AGPL-3.0-only, as its own NOTICE states; that
history is preserved in git history and is not relabeled.

